-## Payment flow
+### Interested in accepting PromptPay as a US business?
 
-![](assets/stripe-promptpay-flow-checkout.svg)
+PromptPay for US-based Stripe accounts is in private preview. Enter your email address to join the waitlist. We'll review your application and contact you if you're eligible.
+
+```bash
+curl https://docs.stripe.com/preview/register \
+  -X POST \
+  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
+  -H "Referer: https://docs.stripe.com/payments/promptpay" \
+  -d '{"email": "EMAIL", "preview": "boku_promptpay_preview"}'
+```
+
